name: Context experiments retain failed attempts and stop at protected limits
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 planned | approved-fixed-matrix
expect: Jobs: 6
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | approved-matrix-terms
expect: 2 contexts · 6 fixed jobs · 1 worker(s)
ask: Does the approved six-job matrix name the two context cases, three passes each, one worker and finite allowance before a separate launch?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 6 planned | launch-origin
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | first-dispatch
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance reached | partial-jobs
expect: 4 completed
expect: 1 failed
expect: 1 parked
expect: Allowance reached
expect: R report
expect: a plan/allowance
ask: Is the failed pass distinct from the unstarted pass, with a truthful partial outcome and visible Report and allowance choices?
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance reached | mixed-stop-40x12
expect: R report
expect: a plan/allowance
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
keys: a Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT CASES | retained-context-cases
keys: v
require-live-snap: 25 observed 2 / 2 | partial-alpha-results
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 25 observed 1 / 2 | partial-beta-results
keys: Up
live-snap: partial-results
ask: Are the two contexts' completed-pass denominators distinct from three planned passes, with failures and remaining work disclosed without changing confidence?
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
live-snap: partial-results-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.3
live-snap: partial-evidence-40x12
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
keys: Escape Escape Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled synthetic bounded matrix signal | one-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive J363 operator decision: owned greeting is intentional
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | human-fp
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reviewed
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 4 completed | existing-partial-matrix
nav-mode:
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 2 | partial-scoped-report
expect: 5 committed / 7 calls
expect: 3 raw observations
expect: Recorded attempts: 5 · 4 completed, 1 failed
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | partial-json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | partial-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial-report
ask: Does the partial export keep the failed and pending work, separate case recurrence, all three raw observations and the human FP decision while protecting Review capacity?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 4 completed | partial-report-origin
keys: a Home Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Total calls | edit-specific-total
type: 9
keys: Enter Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Attempts per job | edit-specific-attempts
type: 2
keys: Enter L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | explicit-revision
expect: Total provider calls: 9
expect: Protected review calls: 2
expect: 6 fixed jobs
expect: Recorded calls: 5 committed
expect: Left under proposed limits: 2 context/scan · 2 protected Review
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Used 5 · left Scan 2 Review 2 | explicit-revision-40x12
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | explicit-revision-restored
ask: Does the revision retain the five spent calls, same six jobs and two protected Review calls while explicitly permitting two remaining discovery calls and a second attempt?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | revised-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Plan approved | same-jobs-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | remaining-dispatch
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | original-six-completed
expect: 2 total attempts
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Current attempt counter: 1 | retried-job-details
expect: 2 total attempts
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 Fixed jobs | retried-job-origin
keys: a Home Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT CASES | completed-context-cases
keys: v
require-live-snap: 25 observed 3 / 3 | completed-alpha-results
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 25 observed 1 / 3 | completed-beta-results
keys: b Enter Enter Down Down
require-live-snap: 25 Pass 3 | missed-candidate-pass
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 RUN DIFF | completed-pass-comparison
require-live-snap: 25 1 not observed | missed-is-not-fixed
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded content fingerprints match | exact-source-comparison
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT CASES | comparison-origin
resize: 160x48
wait: 1
live-snap: completed-results-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 1
live-snap: completed-results-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 1
live-snap: completed-results-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 1
live-snap: completed-results-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
live-snap: completed-results-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage End
wait: 0.3
live-snap: completed-evidence-end-40x12
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 2 | completed-scoped-report
expect: 7 committed / 9 calls
expect: 4 raw observations
expect: Recorded attempts: 7 · 6 completed, 1 failed
expect: 1 pending · TP: 0 · FP: 0
keys: Escape Escape Escape Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled synthetic bounded matrix signal | reappeared-finding
require-live-snap: 25 Decision source check: | prior-fp-retained
expect: Later source identity is unverified.
expect: check source
expect: J363 operator decision
ask: Does the new observation retain the earlier operator FP and clearly request reassessment, without silently deleting that decision or starting paid Review work?
submit: dismiss false_positive J363 explicit reaffirmation: latest owned greeting is intentional
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | explicitly-reaffirmed-fp
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reaffirmed
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | completed-triage-origin
nav-mode:
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 0 pending · TP: 0 · FP: 1 | completed-reviewed-report
keys: p Home
require-live-snap: 25 Attempt: matrix-limits-alpha-trial-002-a1 · failed | retained-failed-attempt
resize: 160x48
wait: 1
live-snap: report-attempts-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 1
live-snap: report-attempts-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 1
live-snap: report-attempts-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 1
live-snap: report-attempts-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
keys: Home
live-snap: report-attempts-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-attempts-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-attempts-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-attempts-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-attempts-page-4
