live-snap: report-attempts-page-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-attempts-page-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-attempts-page-8
keys: End
live-snap: report-attempts-end-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-attempts-back-40x12
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
keys: p Home
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | final-json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | final-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the completed result preserve the failed historical attempt, honest per-case recurrence and FP decision, with readable evidence and faithful export at every viewport?
keys: Escape Escape Escape Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/study-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | recovered-original-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 2 | recovered-scoped-report
expect: 7 committed / 9 calls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/matrix_limits.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the same fixed jobs, seven attempts including the failure, four observations, exact context and source, the retained FP decision and unchanged spending without another request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
